      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If you define a "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "custom font"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "custom-font.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " in the font catalog in a theme that extends from "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "default"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", and you want to continue to use the bundled fonts in your theme, you either have to redeclare the bundled fonts:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "extends: default\nfont:\n  catalog:\n    Noto Serif:\n      normal: GEM_FONTS_DIR/notoserif-regular-subset.ttf\n      bold: GEM_FONTS_DIR/notoserif-bold-subset.ttf\n      italic: GEM_FONTS_DIR/notoserif-italic-subset.ttf\n      bold_italic: GEM_FONTS_DIR/notoserif-bold_italic-subset.ttf\n    M+ 1mn:\n      normal: GEM_FONTS_DIR/mplus1mn-regular-subset.ttf\n      bold: GEM_FONTS_DIR/mplus1mn-bold-subset.ttf\n      italic: GEM_FONTS_DIR/mplus1mn-italic-subset.ttf\n      bold_italic: GEM_FONTS_DIR/mplus1mn-bold_italic-subset.ttf\n    Your Font:\n      normal: /path/to/your/font.ttf\nheading:\n  font-family: Your Font"
              }
            ],
            "language": "yaml",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Redeclaring the bundle fonts in a custom theme"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "or you need to set "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "merge: true"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " above your font definitions:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "extends: default\nfont:\n  catalog:\n    merge: true\n    Your Font:\n      normal: /path/to/your/FontName-Regular.ttf\n      italic: /path/to/your/FontName-Italic.ttf\n      bold: /path/to/your/FontName-Bold.ttf\n      bold_italic: /path/to/your/FontName-BoldItalic.ttf\nheading:\n  font-family: Your Font"
              }
            ],
            "language": "yaml",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Merging with the inherited font catalog"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If you want to refer to a bundled font in your font catalog, you need to prefix the path with "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "GEM_FONTS_DIR"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " (or add "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "GEM_FONTS_DIR"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " to the value of the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "pdf-fontsdir"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " attribute) so the converter can find and register it. You can find the bundle font definitions in default theme."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If your font only has a single style, or you want to use the same style for all four font styles, assign the font path directly to the key that declares the font name:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "listing",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "extends: default\nfont:\n  catalog:\n    merge: true\n    Your Font: /path/to/your/FontName-Regular.ttf\nheading:\n  font-family: Your Font"
              }
            ],
            "language": "yaml",
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Mapping a single font to all four font styles"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "When not using this shorthand, you must map all four font styles."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
